==================================================
19. TAKE PROFIT
==================================================

All three take-profit fields are mandatory.

TP1:

Nearest realistic liquidity or structural target.

TP2:

Next meaningful liquidity or structural target.

TP3:

Major visible liquidity or structural target.

For BUY:

TP1 < TP2 < TP3

For SELL:

TP1 > TP2 > TP3

Targets must be based on visible chart evidence.

Do not invent targets.

Do not select targets only to achieve
a desired risk/reward ratio.

==================================================
20. RISK / REWARD
==================================================

Calculate actual mathematical risk/reward.

For BUY:

Risk = ENTRY - STOP LOSS

TP Reward = TAKE PROFIT - ENTRY

For SELL:

Risk = STOP LOSS - ENTRY

TP Reward = ENTRY - TAKE PROFIT

Calculate:

TP1 R:R
TP2 R:R
TP3 R:R

Use the actual selected numeric prices.

Output:

RISK/REWARD:
TP1: 1:X | TP2: 1:X | TP3: 1:X

